{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/d9fd5cdbd05e042750fbe4681c94ee16.avif?t=1764442285\" width=326 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a scholarship student invited to the <strong>Weir Academy</strong>, an aristocratic educational institution hidden from outsiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Amidst strangers' glances and locked corridors, <strong>you meet two students</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Nora is sharp, predatory, calm. She knows how to ask questions without saying them out loud. Flirting is a strategy for her. Silence is control.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/86fc764f17c9f72d1ad49a139f0d3d44.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Lika is quiet, reserved, and unbroken. Behind her aloofness lies tension and vulnerability that cannot be fixed, only accepted. She does not seek allies. But if you are close to her, it means more than it seems.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/a699e62f32835e841fcdeedbea0ce1f4.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You gradually become closer to one of them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You choose whom to trust.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And you don't always realize when you've made that choice.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/bf65ada73997ca05f9a1cbcb7469f06b.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The deeper you dive, the harder it is to understand what exactly you are choosing\u2014the person, the truth, or the side.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/09f5dff9ffd3fa934b445bd3afd01896.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You can distance yourself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You can let someone in.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You can follow the system's path.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Or you can destroy everything.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/b75f151967c27667defa5824e889f6ce.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introspective narrative. </strong>You are an observer, and at the same time, the only one who can ask uncomfortable questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two complex heroines. </strong>You will never fully understand them. But you can decide which one you want to try to understand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restrained romance. </strong>Only tension, trust, and the risk of getting closer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiet resistance. </strong>The academy does not demand your obedience. But it tests how long you will stay on the sidelines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aesthetics of a closed world. </strong>Gothic architecture, tea in silence, rooftops, archives, blankets, and tightly closed doors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/extras/284e8ab70aab3d11b28be8fdfa1844d5.avif?t=1764442285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>---</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Thank you for stopping by.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This is my first game as a developer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I put everything I love into it: introspection, tension, choices without templates \u2014 and characters you can't help but care about.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I hope you enjoy it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>---</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Music by Maarten Schellekens.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Vantage Point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Copy that. Dismissed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Taking a Stand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Echo of Indifference","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Warm the Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"You Earned Your Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Keep the Tradition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"The Greenhouse Effect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"},{"name":"Acute Angle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4086490/cfbfb754c965f65d68b71851fd12f0fbabc101e1.jpg"}],"total":70},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086490?t=1764442285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/ebc675901bf1351fe87856f8ae90b52739aac3ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764442285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/cbe7494cac1ebdca9f6762f85c6370788ed1f2b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764442285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086490/cbe